  "the travel store": "ts_cooler, ts_shelving and ts_endcap are a tile long so a run of C or of G is one run; ts_shelving is three double runs of gondolas; ts_endcap puts an end cap on each of the gondolas' three lines on both its edges, lined up with ts_shelving's at your 'at' [0.5, 0.72] and [0.5, 0.95]; ts_counter is 11 m with its ends finished, so KK leaves a way through between two.",
  "the service bay": "ts_trailer is a 40-foot van with both its ends, so TT is two trailers nose to tail; ts_cab stands nose to the camera, uncoupled, its hood tilted forward (one picture serves the cab west of its trailers and the cab east of them); ts_lift a four-post lift east to west.",
